Documents Establishing the Eligibility of Supplies
To establish the eligibility of the supplies and related services, in accordance with ITB Clause 6, bidders shall complete the country-of-origin declarations in the Price Schedule included in Section 4, Bidding Forms.
Bidders with a current registration with the Authority are not required to submit:
A copy of the bidder’s current trading license or equivalent;
A copy of the bidder’s certificate of registration or equivalent;
But should include details of their Authority registration number in the bid submission sheet.

